://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-09T16:08:56Z","updated_at":"2023-02-09T16:36:18Z","body":"There was a bug in the method: CreateCDCStreamForNamespace, which only marks the stream as ACTIVE only after we add the last table we get from \"ListUserTables\".\r\nIf there were no tables in the namespace with PKs, the stream would remain in INITIATED state.\r\nNow we will filter out the valid tables found under the namespace, if we find out there are no valid tables, we will mark the Stream's state as ACTIVE in the first call itself.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1424442554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"adithya-kb","id":24984282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0OTg0Mjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24984282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb","html_url":"https://github.com/adithya-kb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adithya-kb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.gi